<h3><u>Tu dekh nahi pata jabir</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Acha hai teri beenai nahi,<br />
tu dekh nahi paata jabir..(2)</p>

<p>Thi binte ali bazaro&#39;n mein..(2)<br />
be maqna o be parda jabir<br />
tu dekh nahi paata jabir</p>

<p>1. Jabir ye zameene karbobala<br />
zahra ka yaha&#39;n gulshan bikhra<br />
jis jaa pe khade ho tum jabir<br />
ghode se yahee&#39;n abbas gira<br />
pyaasi thi bateeji khaime mein..(2)<br />
be baazu hua saqqa jabir<br />
tu dekh nahi paata jabir</p>

<p>2. Atthara baras ka bhai mera<br />
seene mein lagi naize ki ani<br />
jabir ye sunoge kis tarha<br />
shabbir ki bhi beenayi gayi<br />
bus ek qadam hi chalte the..(2)<br />
girte the mere maula jabir<br />
tu dekh nahi paata jabir</p>

<p>3. Akbar, asghar, qasim na rahe<br />
the aun o mohammad ke laashe<br />
is par bhi ruki na zoro jafa<br />
sabke laashe pamaal hue<br />
shabbir pe chalta tha khanjar..(2)<br />
zainab thi sare khaima jabir<br />
tu dekh nahi paata jabir</p>

<p>3. Phir shaam e ghareeba aa pohchi<br />
khaimo ko jalaya aada ne<br />
phupiyo&#39;n ki ridao&#39;n ko meri<br />
naizo&#39;n se utaara aada ne<br />
jalta tha sakina ka kurta..(2)<br />
asghar ka kahi&#39;n jhula jabir<br />
tu dekh nahi paata jabir</p>

<p>4. Aaghaz e imamat tha mera<br />
tohfe mein mile zanjeer o rasan<br />
poshak yateemi ki pehne<br />
zakhmo se bhara tha mera badan<br />
gardan ka lahu pairo se baha..(2)<br />
ye waqt bhi tha aaya jabir<br />
tu dekh nahi paata jabir</p>

<p>5. Bazaar ka haal suno jabir<br />
pathhar the kabhi shole the kabhi<br />
ummat thi tamashayi saari<br />
aur aale mohammad the qaidi<br />
aur habshi ghulamo ki tarha..(2)<br />
bazaaro&#39;n mein khencha jabir<br />
tu dekh nahi paata jabir</p>

<p>6. Bazaar hua jab khatm to phir<br />
darbaar qayamat aaya tha<br />
darbaar sharabi majme mein<br />
zainab ko pukara jaata tha<br />
paigham e hussaini ki khatir..(2)<br />
jaise wo rahi zinda jabir<br />
tu dekh nahi paata jabir</p>

<p>7. Hasrat thi rihai ki jisko<br />
zinda&#39;n se reha wo ho na saki<br />
darti thi andhere se bacchi<br />
turbat bhi andhere mein hi bani<br />
zinda&#39;n mein sakina ka haaye..(2)<br />
haatho&#39;n pe tha jab laasha jabir<br />
tu dekh nahi paata jabir</p>

<p>8. Salman karega kaise bayaa&#39;n<br />
meesum jo mere maula ne kaha<br />
beenai meri rukhsat na hui<br />
ankho&#39;n se magar khoo&#39;n itna baha<br />
aankho&#39;n ke lahu se surkh hua..(2)<br />
tha shaam ka sab rasta jabir<br />
tu dekh nahi paata jabir</p>

<p>Acha hai teri beenai nahi,<br />
tu dekh nahi paata jabir..(3)</p>
